   "core/parsers/costco_hybrid.py - Costco US 3-page PO (Wrangler).\n\nLayout (72000164/72000165/72000166):\n  page 0  - header block (PO Number / Season / Ship Date / port row / ...) +\n            a single summary line (Units / Cost / Total) + per-size OWA totals.\n  page 1  - a colour x size grid where the size columns are UNITS PER CARTON\n            (``LGB ... 13 2 2 2 2 2 2 1`` = colour total 13, sizes per carton).\n  page 2  - TTL/OWA cross-check.\n\nThe size columns print per-carton quantities; the real order total = per-carton\nx number-of-cartons (printed as ``Total NNN,NNN units of M,MMM cartons``). This\nmirrors FRANKIE's per-carton semantics but with NUMERIC sizes (4..16) instead of\nXS..XXL, so it is its own isolated layout.\n\nISOLATED: self-contained; does not touch matrix_* / line_items / control_sheet.\n",
